Hermit Nerd Font is Hermit patched with Nerd Fonts icons and symbols.
This package installs the upstream OpenType fonts in Regular, Bold,
Italic, Light, and Bold Italic and Light Italic styles.

The font family is named Hurmit Nerd Font after patching. Nerd Font,
Mono, and Propo variants are included. Choose Hurmit Nerd Font Mono
for single-cell icons in a terminal.

The package version follows the Nerd Fonts release. No font patching
is needed. Installation and removal refresh font caches; restart any
applications that do not pick up font changes automatically.
